</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_Brown_et_al./10.E:_Gases_(Exercises)" class="mt-section" id="section_76"><span id="Q10.8.16"></span><h3 class="editable">Q10.8.16</h3>

