<p>Samples of HBr gas and NH<sub>3</sub> gas are placed at opposite ends of a 1 m tube. If the two gases are allowed to diffuse through the tube toward one another, at what distance from each end of the tube will the gases meet and form solid NH<sub>4</sub>Br?</p>

