</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_Brown_et_al./10.E:_Gases_(Exercises)" class="mt-section" id="section_87"><span id="Q10.9.7"></span><h3 class="editable">Q10.9.7</h3>

